note S5 scrub reached through two calls, both compiled before a long global (length 5000 > 4095, so it
note would pin base and length) that main reads after the chain returns. omc 0d7f2f42 pinned it and the
note scrub cleared both pins without restoring them: trap 3, exit 103. Exit 0 is the pass.
om2
fn deep to ulong
k = scrub 64
ret ulong k
end
fn mid to ulong
k = deep
ret k
end
global g ulong 5000
fn main to int
j = ulong 4999
put g j 11
k = mid
y = get g j
if ne y 11
ret 2
end
ret int k
end
